   "roundness": null,
   "text": "the TERRAIN the work will change \u2014 actual code, read not summarized.\nthe order must name exact paths, signatures and values, and it\ncannot do that from memory.\nWHAT WE RULED OUT \u2014 a contract proposes implementation choices.\nSTANDING DECISIONS \u2014 the conventions a work order cannot violate.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "the TERRAIN the work will change \u2014 actual code, read not summarized.\nthe order must name exact paths, signatures and values, and it\ncannot do that from memory.\nWHAT WE RULED OUT \u2014 a contract proposes implementation choices.\nSTANDING DECISIONS \u2014 the conventions a work order cannot violate.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
