   "roundness": null,
   "text": "every piece is MEASURABLE against an upstream declaration: the design\npackage, the measurements, the countermeasures. provided that\nmeasuring is real, the human reads nothing at this rung.\na piece NOTHING upstream declared cannot be measured, so it cannot\npass by assertion \u2014 it is a PUSH-BACK to design.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
