   "roundness": null,
   "text": "pieces flow to builders under the two-tier rule. the ESCALATION\nCONTRACT governs everything downstream: the human hears ONLY of a\ngap no agent role can answer that is a BLOCKER \u2014 the blocker-\nacceptance path from Test viability. otherwise the next report is\nGOAL ACHIEVED.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "pieces flow to builders under the two-tier rule. the ESCALATION\nCONTRACT governs everything downstream: the human hears ONLY of a\ngap no agent role can answer that is a BLOCKER \u2014 the blocker-\nacceptance path from Test viability. otherwise the next report is\nGOAL ACHIEVED.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
