   "text": "OPEN on this stage \u2014 the delegation half of the machinery that serves this function has never fired:\nthe score-writing call and sized builders exist as one disk-write trial (9:1 compression, tags assigned\ncorrectly), not as a session that built something. The first real delegated build is the test of\neverything on this page.",
